OL,3,GNEWSABlaze breaks out at household
OL,4,Arecycling centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire has broken out at a household
OL,7,Frecycling centre in Peterborough.
OL,9,FCambridgeshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fsaid it was called to the site in
OL,11,FFengate at about 10:30 BST and crews
OL,12,Fwere sent from Stanground and
OL,13,FDogsthorpe, as well as an additional
OL,14,Ffire engine.
OL,16,FFirefighters put out the blaze in a
OL,17,Fskip, with the cause believed to be
OL,18,F"accidental", a spokeswoman for the
OL,19,Fservice said.
OL,21,FThere have been no reported injuries,
OL,22,Fshe added.
